
## Playbook

This project follows the spectro playbook `spectro`. The playbook lives in its own folder next to the project, and the spectroscope app pins that folder to this project, so the app loads it whenever this project is the workspace.

The playbook classifies each request, then runs brainstorm, spec, plan, build with review and finish. Each step names its model and hands a document to the next one. Its test step runs the same check command this file names above.
